data/
.env

# web-dist/ must NOT be excluded here, even though it holds the (gitignored)
# Flutter web build output. The Dockerfile's `COPY web-dist/ /web/` needs
# this directory to reach the build context; excluding it would either fail
# the build outright (COPY of a nonexistent path) or silently copy an empty
# directory, producing an image with no web build in it and no error to say
# why. web-dist/.gitkeep keeps the directory present (and buildable) even
# when nothing has been copied into it yet.
# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored: the published image builds with
# --locked so a given commit always produces the same dependency set.
